# DeepCNT 3.0 — Environment Configuration Template
#
# IMPORTANT:
# 1. This file is a PUBLIC template only.
# 2. NEVER put a real API key in this file.
# 3. For local use, copy this file to `.env` and replace the placeholder
#    with your own API key.
# 4. `.env` must be excluded by `.gitignore`.
#
# Current project interface:
#   DeepSeek API -> DEEPSEEK_API_KEY
#   Default base -> https://api.deepseek.com
#   Default model -> deepseek-flash
#
# The project documentation specifies that the DeepSeek API key is read
# from the project-root `.env` / environment configuration.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DeepSeek
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Required for DeepSeek-powered pipeline / interpretation modules.
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=YOUR_DEEPSEEK_API_KEY_HERE

# Optional: override the default DeepSeek OpenAI-compatible API endpoint.
DEEPSEEK_BASE_URL=https://api.deepseek.com

# Optional: override the model used by modules that read this variable.
# The current DeepCNT configuration uses:
#   deepseek-flash
DEEPSEEK_MODEL=deepseek-flash

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Qwen image / PDF supplementation
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# The current project uses Qwen for image-derived evidence supplementation
# in `pipeline/07_qwen_pdf_image_api.py`.
#
# The repository documentation confirms the model as `qwen3.8-max`, but the
# exact environment-variable name used by the current Qwen script is not
# fixed in the project documentation available here. Therefore, do NOT invent
# a variable name that may not match the code.
#
# Configure the Qwen credential according to the variable name actually
# referenced by `07_qwen_pdf_image_api.py`.
#
# Example placeholder (DO NOT uncomment unless the script actually reads
# this variable):
# QWEN_API_KEY=YOUR_QWEN_API_KEY_HERE

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local project paths
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# The current codebase is designed around paths relative to the project root.
# Do not put your private Windows absolute path here.
#
# Project root:
#   <repository root>
#
# Main public model input:
#   data/11_flattened/ml_dataset_3p0_full60D.csv
#
# Public prompts:
#   prompts/
#   promptsV2/
#
# WorldMap assets:
#   worldmap001.png
#   worldmap002.png
#   worldmap003.png

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Reproducibility / security notes
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Do not commit:
#   .env
#   real API keys
#   raw literature PDFs
#   private datasets
#   private logs containing API responses or credentials
#
# Commit:
#   this template
#   `.gitignore`
#   `README.md`
#   source code
#   prompts
#   promptsV2
#   approved public figures/assets
#   the intended public model-input CSV
#
# If an API key is ever exposed in Git history, revoke/rotate it immediately.
